meta {
  name: list undelivered notifications
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications?limit=50
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 50
}

docs {
  The guild is taken from X-Actor-Guild-Id, never from the query string: a
  caller-supplied filter would let any authenticated raider read every guild's
  outbox. Claiming is destructive in the sense that a claimed row is hidden from
  other pollers for the lease (5 minutes) or until it is acked.
}
